  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N6amWeJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"448\" height=\"239\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Cold Sweat 是一款与原版兼容且高性能的 Minecraft 温度模组，它提供直观且全面的生存体验，包含多种帮助或伤害你的功能。<br>准备充分玩家可以应对 Minecraft 恶劣环境中的极端天气，但如果你将自己困在荒无人烟之处，可没有第二次机会！</p>\n<p>该模组还通过配置文件、JSON 数据包和 KubeJS 提供了深度自定义选项，非常适合整合包或自定义挑战！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cUnhb3Ek3E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5W2wczH.png\" alt=\"Discord Server\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/Momo-Studios/Cold-Sweat/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LS8jcYX.png\" alt=\"Wiki\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmikul.gitbook.io%252fcold-sweat%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/E3TJOkF.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3G55Lz2.png\" alt=\"Fair Use\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/ntIVUKz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"267\" height=\"267\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UPTNuaM.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>动态温度系统：受世界环境和玩家状态影响（生物群系、方块、物品、天气、海拔等）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/zkHjThs.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cg1hY5h.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>帮助玩家抵御恶劣环境的物品和方块</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JY66oAS.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>绝缘护甲以抵抗极端气候</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/rPG3tpz.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>靠近特定方块以升温或降温</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/otCZaYe.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>温度计显示精确的温度数值</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/HMqZC5z.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>使用水袋快速缓解不适，或作为冷却/加热包使用</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0WqSxyR.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>详细的游戏内配置和基于文件的配置选项</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W9vKlTk.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wUkB0JE.png\" alt=\"请勿将此模组与 Configured 一起使用\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AeJAw4A.png\" alt=\"请勿询问 Fabric 移植版本\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>~ 特殊集成支持 ~</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serene Seasons</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>KubeJS</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thirst-was-taken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Thirst Was Taken</span></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Create</span></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-weather\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Weather</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh, the Biomes You'll Go</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://beta.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Atmospheric</span></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://beta.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Environmental</strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://beta.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Terralith</strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/william-wythers-overhauled-overworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>WW's Overhauled Overworld</strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-ecosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>WW's Expanded Ecosphere</strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weather-storms-tornadoes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weather, Storms, &amp; Tornadoes</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>在原版中，每个生物群系都有各自独立的温度设定。本模组利用这一特性构建温度系统，这意味着该模组应与几乎所有模组生物群系兼容（前提是它们的温度配置正确 ;) ）。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>~</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/f6CqUZy.png\" alt=\"\"></em></p>\n<p>未定义</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
